'''Proficiencies:''' No additional proficiencies are gained.

'''Skills:''' [[concentration]], [[craft armor]], [[craft trap]], [[craft weapon]], [[discipline]], [[Heal (skill)|heal]], [[listen]], [[lore]], [[parry]], [[persuade]], [[search]], [[spellcraft]], [[spot]]

